<title>USA: Shell Oil Co Q4 net up 51 pct.</title>
<headline>Shell Oil Co Q4 net up 51 pct.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net		     $573,000		 $380,000</p>
<p> Revs		   8,327,000		6,537,000</p>
<p>		     Year</p>
<p> Net		   $2,021,000	     $1,520,000</p>
<p> Revs		 $29,151,000	    $24,650,000</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Company is a Royal Dutch/Shell Group subsidiary.</p>
<p>Net included beneficial special items totaling $36 million vs $94 million in qtr and $161 million vs $112 million for the year.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
